    "name_raw": "Improved Plane Shift",
    "definition_type_raw": null,
    "source_book_raw": "Pathfinder Roleplaying Game Planar Adventures",
    "definition_raw": "You’re an expert at traveling the various realms of the Great Beyond via plane shift.\n\nPrerequisite(s): Wizard level 9th.\n\nBenefit(s): Add plane shift to your spell list and to your spellbook as a 5th-level wizard spell. The time required for you to identify a portal’s destination is reduced to 1 round.\n\nIn addition, you automatically identify any plane on which you arrive.\n\nSpecial: A wizard can select this as a wizard bonus feat.\n\nNormal: Plane shift is a 7th-level wizard spell.",
